  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Assistance for Protected Cultivation” by the Agriculture and Co-operation Department, Government of Gujarat aims to promote modern, climate-resilient horticulture practices by providing financial support for protected cultivation infrastructure like mulching, nursery development, and plug nurseries. The scheme encourages self-employment and sustainable income generation for farmers through the use of polyhouses, shed net houses, and starter kits to improve crop productivity and resource efficiency. \n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant should be a resident of Gujarat.\n   1. The applicant should be a farmer.\n\n<br>\n\n",
